--- !u!114 &1460990536
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1460990534}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ea45832cf80cb949b54bcc01f3dc5e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.ImpLineBeat
  _note: 
  _lines:
  - '[amber]Enough[/amber]. Enough tracks, enough buttons, enough guns, enough guilt,
    enough of me watching you sweat over who deserves what. You have earned a breather.
    And so, frankly, have I.'
  - So. Something completely different now. No stakes, no souls, nobody dies, nobody
    gets judged, and there is genuinely no [amber]right[/amber] answer here, there
    never was one. Just the oldest and stupidest and best argument there is.
  - Who would win a fight. I put two things in front of you, you tell me who wins,
    and then, the good part, we find out whether the rest of the bar agrees with
    you or thinks you are an absolute idiot. That is the whole game. Place your bets.
  _clickLockout: 0.25
  _clearAtEnd: 0
